exceptional pairs with n <= 64: 15600; Phi_(2^s) (2^s the power of 2 in the order of a - b) divides X^a + X^b for 6192 of them; Phi_d with d = 2^(v_2(a - b) + 1) divides n and X^a + X^b for 15600 of them
